3|20|Competitions|What should participants reaching a second competition stage receive?|An honorarium|Automatic first prize|A contractor license|No acknowledgement at all|The module provides an honorarium for second-stage participation.
3|21|Competitions|In a project competition, who is ordinarily commissioned to execute the project?|The first-prize winner|The lowest-cost juror|Any supplier selected later|The technical adviser|The project ADC links the winning entry to the design commission.
