3|38|Payment stages|What cumulative percentage has been paid after contract documents?|90 percent|20 percent|40 percent|100 percent|The contract-document stage adds 50 percent to the cumulative 40 percent.
3|39|Payment stages|How much of the regular-design fee remains for construction-stage payment after contract documents?|10 percent|50 percent|60 percent|90 percent|The schedule reaches 90 percent after contract documents, leaving 10 percent.
