3|42|Management fees|What recommended fee range is given for construction management?|1.5 to 3 percent of PCC|1 to 1.5 percent of PCC|7 percent of PCC|10 to 15 percent of cost of work|SPP 204B lists 1.5–3 percent of PCC for CM.
