3|44|Design-build fees|What RPF does the module state for guaranteed-maximum-cost design-build, excluding regular design fees?|10 percent of PCC|1 percent of PCC|4 percent of gross rent|50 percent of PCC|The module states ten percent of PCC, or a fee built into the guaranteed maximum cost.
3|44|Design-build fees|Who directly pays labor and material costs in the module's design-build payment procedure?|The owner or client|The competition jury|The PRBoA|The architect from personal funds in every case|The owner directly funds project expenditure; the architect does not advance the costs.
